{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "5465845e2c872f30784ec3393b9405136593d22c4ead24d1d6557a8551b48680", "ja": "超終幕！　灼熱のビーチ！！", "zh": "超级最终幕！灼热的海滩！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "efa03de794bd25132a9e07c3ad3cf82e15d34feadc05f19804db1bfa0fb0baf7", "ja": "『水着アイドル我慢大会』に出演することに\nなった一同。見事優勝するものの、アイドル\nたち以上に熱くなってしまったプロデューサ\nーは、みんなでかき氷でも食べに行こうと誘\nうのだった。", "zh": "偶像们参加『泳装偶像忍耐大赛』，\n顺利获得冠军，\n制作人却比偶像们还更全身发热，\n于是提议请所有人一起去吃刨冰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fb54ffdf194fd9696078674cbfa60f14cb21953f0b31a1559b63dc666a7b2ef5", "ja": "（『超ビーチバレー』の封切りと同時に、タイアップの\n公演も開演となった。連日、満員御礼だ）", "zh": "（《超级沙滩排球》刚首映，合作宣传公演\n也同时开始演出，连续几天都座无虚席。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0989d11dbd2dddc4675b53fad472ce6573e15c75c41ac3dbb21d69cd6dc66d89", "ja": "（さらに、以前オーディションを受けていた\n『水着アイドル我慢大会』も出演が決まり……！）", "zh": "（此外，她们先前参加过试镜的『泳装偶像忍耐大赛』\n也敲定演出了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "eb02be3135d332539469ebd89eea5760a633bd49d8be230d4a1d7c6bd97e841c", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……や、やりましたよ、\n{$P$}っ！　私たちの優勝です！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……我、我们办到了，\n{$P$}！冠军是我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "6fb5d615fd9fa580a64097c766f5f144df2c1f9caa030391dbbfc7902badfe95", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……あ～っ、キツかった～！\nもうちょっとで倒れるかと思ったよ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……啊～好累～！\n我还以为我要昏倒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "7aafe4d6c74d0fe91f74ae75c71e0b97e5c52a855303fdc467c95209deaa3ae3", "ja": "でもこれって、映画のいい宣伝になるよね？\nにゃはは♪", "zh": "不过这对电影来说会是不错的宣传吧？\n呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "02c5e907322f2ff6493956f5920577eaa5736bc89636b2cad37012560b5475b9", "ja": "ああ、間違いない！\nよく頑張ってくれたな、みんな。", "zh": "嗯，就是说啊！\n大家都很努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "7a8467bf4d2ffa538a8c728caa92dea738b29be17449865c29bfbf61d292b929", "ja": "み、みみ水！　水ちょうだいっ！\n暑いのは平気だけど、からいのはムリ～～っ！", "zh": "水，我要水！给我水！\n我不怕热，但辣的我不行啦～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_1007", "source_sha256": "be03c29a1bada4569be09ff4595d4e096ce67966c67240abda72a31d9c8dc2e4", "ja": "わかった！", "zh": "知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_2000_p", "source_sha256": "2b556a558236c3cc741a638c9ba7b6cb2613b936194bf51ba960e0969a0cbd12", "ja": "わかった、ほら水だ！\n紗代子も恵美も、水分補給！", "zh": "我知道了，来，水给你！\n纱代子和惠美也来补充水分吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "e954b9092c03bedb6c63d4bca9640121999d6da408c2891270e8356e49edb333", "ja": "ぜぇ、ぜぇ……ふ、風花、しっかり……。\n私ら、まだまだ、こんなもんちゃうやろ……！", "zh": "呼、呼……风、风花，振作点……\n我们、可不会轻易被打败、对吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_2002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d2a6e7a28368c3f21ca1753b12f005419c91c74a6dcc3a73e7a216ceec909c21", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ、ハァ……な、奈緒ちゃん……。\n大丈夫、まだ……いけるわ……ハァ、ハァ……。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……奈、奈绪……\n没问题，我还……撑得下去……呼，呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_2003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e10fce8f77f074c1b4f4601597a30691a0fbd41ac5576479a29b5d6bbfecf078", "ja": "私たちは……帝花女学院、超ビーチバレー部の……。\nキングと、クイーンなんだから……！", "zh": "毕竟我们可是……帝花女子学院、超级沙滩排球社的……\n王者和、女王啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_2004", "source_sha256": "c2cf7125db6ddab03d627cce26b84e953d06249fe8563136ff1d5b1df55480e5", "ja": "もういいんだ！", "zh": "已经够了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3000_p", "source_sha256": "a5189eb7c6b53f81c609b0d1324449ed3144710f83f78151d12899a937eba166", "ja": "いいからほら、奈緒も風花も水だ！\nもういいんだ、もう終わったんだ……！", "zh": "可以了，来，奈绪和风花也喝杯水！\n已经够了，已经结束了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3001_029umi", "source_sha256": "f1efd3d9c82e54fa50f457c78f4ef8285d43baa919954248f9d18140e157e284", "ja": "ぷはーっ！　おいしーっ！　生き返るーっ！\nありがと、{$P$}♪", "zh": "噗哈～！好好喝～！整个人都清爽起来了～！\n谢啦，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3002_020meg", "source_sha256": "a2c881ba0f6b1bd8b5d9e0266eef93287ee1849ceb2a75d43176ff638147d384", "ja": "うひゃ～っ、すっごい汗……。\nねえねえ{$P$}、ふいてくれる？", "zh": "呀啊～流了好多汗……\n欸欸{$P$}，你可以帮我擦一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3003_p", "source_sha256": "a38bc4d1f7464cdfeda41e2554574da4b940d5787ac132ff342b2ba60b939346", "ja": "ああ、わかっ……いや、水着の時はどうだろうな。\n悪いけど、自分でふいてくれ。", "zh": "好，我来……不对，穿泳装时这样好吗？\n抱歉，你还是自己擦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3004_020meg", "source_sha256": "b9650075530a2896f29d74b639f73e244ac700e448ea2a177fe208ac9ef94b51", "ja": "え～、別にいいじゃん、そんなの……って、あれ？\nなんか{$P$}も汗かいてない？", "zh": "咦～这又没关系……嗯，奇怪了？\n{$P$}你是不是也在冒汗啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3005_029umi", "source_sha256": "bb50da87bafd1ef470b82dfa95d6f0311fa6728bc8789ab76a24bb7a5f7db9e0", "ja": "あっ、ホントだっ！　どうしたの？\n大丈夫？　なんか病気になったの！？", "zh": "啊，真的欸！怎么啦？\n你还好吗？是不是生了什么病吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3006_p", "source_sha256": "f3f2442bee66f5339c1194d9159777fd83ea0ddda6f5dee534970e74c87dc3d0", "ja": "はは、大丈夫だよ。ただ、みんながガマンする姿を\n見てたら、こっちまで身体が熱くなってきて……。", "zh": "哈哈，没事啦。我只是看着大家忍耐的样子，\n自己也开始浑身发热了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3007_027say", "source_sha256": "2feeb6ded2bb6156c04a78522a963013ca73408034307ebedfc1ef4fbb53f714", "ja": "それは……！\n私たちは、心でつながっている……ってことですよね！", "zh": "这……！\n这代表我们的心联系在一起……是这样没错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3008_037nao", "source_sha256": "317de9abd83fc4a079ad7ecfcfa1af14b903b4e0b97c02a4dc6ca8de7708dcbc", "ja": "自己催眠みたいなもんとちゃうんかな……。\nていうか、ホンマに大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "我看那比较像是自我催眠吼……\n话说，你真的没事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3d20ad5f519878844aded71bccd9598f2de083c325c4a10c97db1643ef9dc828", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、ちゃんとお水を\n飲んでくださいね。脱水症状を甘く見たらダメですよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你也要好好喝水。\n不可以小看脱水症状喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3010_p", "source_sha256": "51c24c5d0f008d745f3e67a023acb382e60aaa6fab51e3d808f5ae757cdadec3", "ja": "そ、そうだな、ありがとう……。\nそうだ。帰りにみんなで、かき氷でも食べに行くか？", "zh": "也、也对，谢谢你……\n对了，回去的时候，要不要大家一起去吃个刨冰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3011_029umi", "source_sha256": "e33b29d924e10b260c6037c26eb8a1e22c85c108a0eee8387186bb66293f99c8", "ja": "えっ、かき氷！？　いいの！？", "zh": "咦，刨冰！？可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3012_p", "source_sha256": "52e173563fb7faf5e567913994ef8a8f560511e1fd6387574cad0d9f4789fd4d", "ja": "ああ、今日はみんな、頑張ってくれたからな。\nごちそうするよ！", "zh": "嗯，因为今天大家都很努力啊。\n我请你们吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3013_029umi", "source_sha256": "ad346323307ab20d57921e72d4fdb519afe37afc611acacb5250a1762682efb4", "ja": "やったーっ☆", "zh": "太棒了～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3014_020meg", "source_sha256": "6de6b1a1b7bea23f85ed5c3fe99adb235e2b76fe209b650ed9335d5f8075afc1", "ja": "やった～っ♪", "zh": "太棒了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3015_027say", "source_sha256": "e0bdcfa8f27517c6588bc2641e6ed8b09df9b303ab3e349995840d998d8e2c35", "ja": "やったぁ！", "zh": "太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0f0896436bb2a1c89d73ccb5c5e52e0eff7624d4614f474719ecf76a93363b1d", "ja": "やったぁ♪", "zh": "太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3017_037nao", "source_sha256": "2caf38e55cfa667adc6488e4e3e7be5c249be0357114ec90ce671b3266102429", "ja": "よっしゃ～", "zh": "赞啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3018_029umi", "source_sha256": "24170acdd9c16da41d273317fdb0881ebb932b7009d097ae00564fc472571994", "ja": "よしっ！　そうと決まれば、早く着替えに行こ！\nあっ、でもその前に……みんな、ほら！", "zh": "很好！既然这么决定了，就赶快去换衣服吧！\n啊，但在这之前……大家，来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3019_020meg", "source_sha256": "584bea23fb893a07542453f964abc6f111d942ce63446d18aa63bdd18d946dd5", "ja": "うん、オッケー♪", "zh": "嗯，OK♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3020_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3021_020meg", "source_sha256": "6d79840650f19f69b401648282d941b65d347c611764c0bb40c80557ca9b0550", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}。\nえ～っと……はい、せーのっ！", "zh": "听我说，{$P$}。\n呃……来，预备～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_07_3022_029umi", "source_sha256": "713924fb7193fedaec0142efedb7ae279f5cc75f1cca70472e45a52aee07b3dc", "ja": "ありがとうございましたっ☆", "zh": "谢谢你☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
